# 
_pdbx_nmr_details.entry_id   1CKX 
_pdbx_nmr_details.text       
;THE SOLUTION STRUCTURES OF THE PEPTIDE (P26) BASED ON THE PHE508 REGION OF 
CFTR WERE DETERMINED BY HOMONUCLEAR 1H NMR SPECTROSCOPY PERFORMED AT 600 MHZ. 
THE PEPTIDE WAS SYNTHETICALLY MADE AND WAS UNLABELED. NOESY AT 100, 200 AND 300 
MS MIXING TIMES, A TOCSY AT 65 MS AND COSY SPECTRA WERE COLLECTED AT 25OC IN 
43% TFE-D2 AND H2O.
;
